---
title: FastMCP Test Server
endpoints:
  - name: FastMCP
    url: http://localhost:30800/mcp
---
Tools     echo, add, multiply, to_upper, concat, word_count, reverse
Auth      disabled; recreate with --set authToken=<token> to require a bearer

Health    GET  /health
Admin     POST /admin/tools/hidden_tool/enable

  curl -s http://localhost:30800/mcp \
    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -H 'Accept: application/json, text/event-stream' \
    -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"gck","version":"1.0"}}}'
